(slower-x8-sv03-launch-climb-3dof)
*title Skywalker X8 point-mass powered launch climb reduction
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.001 altitude-m=220.0
*runtime status route mode=great-circle start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=20.0 powered-speed-mps=17.9
*runtime control throttle vehicle=1 default=0.7407992605852429 lower=0 upper=1
*trajectory 1 x8 start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=178.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=17.9 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 mass=3.364
  *segment 1 launch-climb
    *integ dtprnt=0.2 dt=0.05
    *fly alpha=7.9
    *aero cx=(cx-static) cy=(cy-static) cz=(cz-static) sref=0.75
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0
    *when time>20.0 stop
*end
